# DATA LICENSING ADDENDUM

This repository redistributes Scripture text files (in the `data/` directory) provided by [eBible.org](https://ebible.org). The source code of this application is licensed under the MIT License (above), but the embedded Bible data is subject to its own respective licenses:

1. **Public Domain / CC0**:
   - **BSB** (Berean Study Bible)
   - **KJV** (King James Version 2006)
   - **WEB** (World English Bible)
   - **LSV** (Literal Standard Version)
   - **VUC** (Latin Vulgate Clementine)
   - **EPO** (Esperanto Londono)
   These texts are free from copyright restrictions.

2. **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)**:
   - **NOBLB** (Biblica® Open En Levende Bok: Det Nye Testamentet / Norwegian Living New Testament)
   Copyright © 1978, 1988, 2005 by Biblica, Inc.
   *This work is made available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA). You are free to share and redistribute this translation in any format, provided you include this copyright notice. If you modify or translate this work, you must remove the Biblica® trademark and distribute your contributions under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 license.*

For full details, please refer to the `copr.htm` or similar license files included within the respective `.usfm.zip` archives in the `data/` directory.
